const faqs=[
 ['What is Xnovah AI?','Xnovah is an AI-powered workspace in development, designed to bring content creation, visual production, research, and productivity tools into a more connected experience. Our goal is simple: help you spend less time switching tools and more time moving ideas forward.'],
 ['What can I create with Xnovah?','We are developing a broad creative toolkit for writing, marketing content, images, video, voice, research, and more. The exact tools available at launch will be announced as each capability is prepared and tested.'],
 ['Is Xnovah available now?','Xnovah is preparing for launch. You can explore the website to discover our product direction and join the early-access list to receive updates as availability is confirmed.'],
 ['How does early access work?','We plan to introduce Xnovah gradually, starting with selected users. This gives us an opportunity to learn from real projects, refine the experience, and prepare for wider access. Joining the list keeps you informed but does not guarantee an invitation date.'],
 ['Will Xnovah support multiple AI models?','That is part of our approach. Different tasks benefit from different AI capabilities, so we are evaluating providers for writing, images, video, voice, and other workflows. Supported models will depend on the final integrations and plans.'],
 ['Can I work with writing, images, video, and voice in one workspace?','Bringing these creative formats closer together is central to our vision. We are working toward a connected experience, with individual tools introduced according to technical readiness and provider availability.'],
 ['Will there be templates for different projects?','We are exploring templates and guided workflows for marketing, social content, ecommerce, business communication, and everyday creative tasks. The available collection will be confirmed as the product develops.'],
 ['Is Xnovah suitable for businesses and client work?','Xnovah is being designed with creators, freelancers, entrepreneurs, marketers, and growing teams in mind. Details about commercial usage, content rights, and any feature-specific restrictions will be included in the relevant terms when plans launch.'],
 ['Will Xnovah connect with the apps I already use?','We are exploring connections with social, messaging, commerce, and productivity platforms. The connected-app showcase illustrates the direction we are considering; supported integrations will be announced when available.'],
 ['Can Xnovah help with documents and research?','Document understanding, summaries, and research assistance are among the workflows we are exploring. As with any AI-assisted research, important information should be checked against reliable sources.'],
 ['Can I use Xnovah on my phone?','We are designing Xnovah with desktop, tablet, and mobile experiences in mind. The tools and controls available on each device may vary as the product develops.'],
 ['How much will Xnovah cost?','Pricing has not been announced yet. We are evaluating plans based on the capabilities offered and the resources required to run them. Join the early-access list to hear when pricing details are available.'],
 ['What happens when I join the early-access list?','You can receive relevant launch announcements, product news, and early-access updates by email. Signing up is not a paid subscription, and you can unsubscribe from updates.'],
 ['Can I suggest features or share feedback?','Absolutely. We want to understand which tasks take the most time, what tools people rely on, and where a more connected AI experience could make a real difference. Feedback will help inform our priorities.']
];
