<section className="section ecosystem-section"><div className="shell ecosystem-layout"><motion.div {...floatIn} className="ecosystem-copy"><SectionEyebrow>POWERED BY POSSIBILITIES</SectionEyebrow><h2>The right intelligence.<br/><span className="serif-italic">For every ambition.</span></h2><p>No single AI model excels at everything. Writing persuasive copy, developing striking visuals, producing video, and working through complex questions each call for different strengths. Xnovah is being shaped around a flexible, multi-model approach that brings specialized AI capabilities into a more cohesive experience.</p><p className="ecosystem-small">Our goal is to help you focus on the outcome—not the complexity behind the technology. We are evaluating model providers for creative production, research, voice, and intelligent workflows, with supported options to be introduced as the platform develops.</p><a href="#waitlist" className="text-link">Explore early access <ArrowUpRight size={17}/></a></motion.div><div className="ecosystem-art"><div className="ecosystem-core"><span>✳</span><b>XNOVAH</b></div>{["OpenAI","Gemini","Claude","Grok","DeepSeek","Sora 2","Google Veo 2","Google Veo 3","Kling AI","Kling 2.1","Luma AI","MiniMax","FLUX","Stable Diffusion","Ideogram","Google Imagen 4","Midjourney","Perplexity","ElevenLabs","HeyGen","Synthesia","Seedream","Nano Banana Pro","Sora"].map((label,i)=>{const outer=i<16;const angle=(i%(outer?16:8))/(outer?16:8)*Math.PI*2-Math.PI/2+(outer?0:Math.PI/8);const x=50+Math.cos(angle)*(outer?43:25);const y=50+Math.sin(angle)*(outer?43:25);return <div className="model-pill" style={{left:x+'%',top:y+'%'}} key={label}><span>✦</span>{label}</div>})}<div className="ecosystem-circle ec1"/><div className="ecosystem-circle ec2"/></div></div></section>
